{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54658","headline":"兵要望江南 占天第十（十一首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占天第十（十一首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天色白，惨惨甚昏曚。\n久阴不雨阴谋事，必爲兵火事难通（「通」字据辛本、川本补）。\n年内始知踪（首本作「通」，兹从辛本、川本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}